# Project architecture (authoritative)

This repo at `~/Desktop/projects/minecraft` is a **Minecraft store constructor** (sibling of constructor-mount / textproject). Many storefronts share one frontend engine.

| Local path | What it is | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `frontend/` | Next.js engine | Local clone; compile from `projects/{id}/` |
| `projects/` | Store content packs | **Local** (not the TCG rclone mount) |
| `contentgen/` | Landing art pipeline | Gemini; project-scoped |
| `cardgen/` | Feature/product art | Used for hero/catalog tiles |
| `backend/` | Optional rclone mount | Shared Supabase stack — mount later |
| `sendmail/` | Optional rclone mount | Invoice/auth mail relay — mount later |

`projects/` here is **not** `constructor-mount/projects`. Each Minecraft store is `projects/{id}/`, same pattern as TCG sites and textproject packs.

## Deployment — VPS only, no cPanel

- **Frontend** runs on a frontend VPS (pm2 + nginx) when a store goes live.
- **Backend** (Supabase) is the shared API VPS; mount it with `./mount-backend.sh` when needed.
- There is **no cPanel production deploy**.

## Payments — no Stripe

- **No Stripe.** Checkout: `checkout_init` → billing → `checkout_pay` (gateway TBD) or admin **`checkout_test` success** for demos.
- On test success: `fulfillInternalOrder` → credits granted → **`sendOrderInvoice`** → sendmail `POST /invoice`.

## Mail

- Auth email: GoTrue hook → sendmail `POST /hook`.
- Invoices: commerce edge function → sendmail `POST /invoice` with `MAIL_API_KEY`.

## Company / legal test data

- Seller on invoices: `INVOICE_COMPANY_*` env (mirror `projects/{id}/copy/footer.json` contact block).
